ие звука","calls.sounds.title":"Библиотека звуков","calls.stats.cellular":"Моб.","calls.stats.network":"Сеть {value}","calls.stats.quality":"Качество {value}","calls.stats.throughput":"↓ {down}  ↑ {up} кбит/с","calls.stats.time":"Время {value}","calls.stats.title":"Статистика звонка","calls.stats.wifi":"Wi‑Fi"}"#,
